ign="center">0.001 &#x02013; 0.544</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.119</td><td align="center">0.001 &#x02013; 0.640</td><td align="center">0.001 &#x02013; 0.640</td><td/><td align="center">0.001 &#x02013; 0.708</td><td align="center">0.001 &#x02013; 0.740</td><td align="center">0.001 &#x02013; 0.391</td></tr><tr><td/><td align="left"><italic>Ph</italic>JS</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.000</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">-</td><td align="center"><bold>0.105</bold></td><td align="center">0.001</td></tr><tr><td/><td/><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.733</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 1.507</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 1.167</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 2.321<sup>+</sup></td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 1.431</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.727</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.899</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 1.171<sup>+</sup></td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.732</td><td/><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 1.585<sup>+</sup></td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.277</td></tr><tr><td/><td align="left"><italic>Ph</italic>Tun</td><td align="center">0.003</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.002</td><td align="center">-</td><td align="center">0.001</td></tr><tr><td/><td/><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.721</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 1.126</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.914</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 1.762<sup>+</sup></td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.864</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.712</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.900</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.995</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.752</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 1.149</td><td/><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.305</td></tr><tr><td/><td align="left"><italic>Pm</italic></td><td align="center">0.003</td><td align="center">0.012</td><td align="center">0.013</td><td align="center">0.013</td><td align="center">0.010</td><td align="center">0.001</td><td align="center">0.016</td><td align="center">0.002</td><td align="center">0.007</td><td align="center">0.003</td><td align="center">0.000</td><td align="center">-</td></tr><tr><td/><td/><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.267</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.347</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.524</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.468</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.454</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.445</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.354</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.676</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.264</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.219</td><td align="center">0.000 &#x02013; 0.228</td><td/></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p>*: migration rate significantly different from 0 (<italic>P </italic>&#x0003c; 0.05).</p><p>&#x02021;, <sup>+</sup>: the actual interval could not be reliably estimated because the likelihood surfaces for <italic>&#x003b8; </italic>(&#x02021;) or <italic>m </italic>(<sup>+</sup>) were relatively flat.</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T4" position="float"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p>ML estimates and 90% HPD of time since divergence (t =<italic>t</italic>&#x003bc;) between <italic>Podarcis </italic>species. Only estimates corresponding to a clear peak in the likelihood surface are shown. Species abbreviations are as in table 2.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th/><th align="center"><italic>Pb</italic></th><th align="center"><italic>Pc</italic></th><th align="cente